            <div id="master-plan-details-panel-1" class="master-plan-details master-plan-detail-panel active">
              <h3 class="master-plan-title">Master Plan 1</h3>
              
                
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text master-plan-info"><div class="item"><strong>Overview about Shraddha Paradise</strong><ul><li>Shraddha Paradise is a residential development featuring a large central building structure, extensive parking, and significant green and open spaces, located near major roads.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Land Use and Density</strong><ul><li>Around 20%-30% of the plot is green, anchored by the Lawns and Gardens, so residents can enjoy natural surroundings.</li><li>The open area covers 25%-40% of the plot and the Seating Areas, Pathways, and Pool Deck fill the non-green stretches, giving residents places to relax and move about.</li><li>Only 25%-30% of the plot has been built on, so homes here get more air and light than in a tightly packed complex.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Connectivity Access</strong><ul><li>Swami Vivekanand Road and Western Express Highway are close by, so getting to work or for daily errands is convenient with varied this amenity options including surface and podium or basement.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Amenities Lifestyle</strong><ul><li>The Swimming Pool, Kids' Pool/Splash Pad, and Water Feature/Fountain give residents places to cool off, play, and enjoy aquatic elements.</li><li>This amenity means children have a dedicated outdoor space built into the layout.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Tower Placement Orientation</strong><ul><li>The main residential structure is centrally located on the plot, forming a distinct H-shape.</li><li>This single building is positioned to allow for significant open areas both in front and behind it.</li><li>Its orientation provides residents with views towards the landscaped zones and activity areas.</li><li>The building's design creates internal courtyards that could offer quiet residential outlooks.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Amenity Access</strong><ul><li>Residents can easily walk to the water play area located at the top right of the property.</li><li>The main building is directly adjacent to extensive green spaces, making them readily reachable.</li><li>Outdoor relaxation spots are distributed, ensuring quick access from various parts of the residential block.</li><li>Changing facilities are conveniently placed near the aquatic features for resident use.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Noise Privacy Road Facing</strong><ul><li>Homes facing the main access point on the bottom left may experience some activity sounds.</li><li>The central building's design creates internal-facing units that are shielded from external disturbances.</li><li>Units overlooking the large green areas benefit from a quieter, more private outlook.</li><li>The building's setback from the main entry ramp helps reduce direct road noise for many homes.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Corridor Analysis</strong><ul><li>The H-shaped building design creates open spaces within its form, allowing light and air to penetrate.</li><li>Gaps between the building wings provide clear lines of sight across the property's landscaped zones.</li><li>The layout ensures that residential units are not overly shadowed by other parts of the structure.</li><li>The building's central placement prevents a cramped feeling, offering residents open perspectives.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Internal Circulation Pedestrian</strong><ul><li>People can move freely on foot using the well-defined paths connecting the residential block to outdoor areas.</li><li>Dedicated walking surfaces lead from the building's entrances towards the various recreational spots.</li><li>Residents can stroll around the large central green space using the surrounding walkways.</li><li>The design separates foot traffic from car movement in key areas, enhancing safety.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Child Senior Friendly Zones</strong><ul><li>The property includes a dedicated shallow water area, suitable for younger children to play safely.</li><li>Flat walking surfaces around the central green area are easy for older residents to navigate.</li><li>Shaded seating spots are located near activity areas, offering comfortable resting places for all ages.</li><li>The design incorporates areas for gentle recreation, appealing to both children and older residents.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Green Cover Landscape</strong><ul><li>A substantial green expanse occupies the central part of the property, offering a large communal area.</li><li>Smaller planted sections are integrated along the edges of the main residential structure.</li><li>A prominent square water feature is set within a large green zone at the bottom of the plan.</li><li>Landscaped strips line the property boundaries, adding to the overall natural feel.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Traffic Flow Access Planning</strong><ul><li>Cars enter and exit the property from a single point on the lower left side.</li><li>A wide drive-through lane allows for convenient drop-offs and pick-ups near the building entrance.</li><li>Vehicles can access above-ground this amenity spaces located directly in front of the residential block.</li><li>A ramp provides access to lower-level this amenity, managing car storage efficiently.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Overall Livability Assessment</strong><ul><li>This area offers a living environment where outdoor leisure is a central part of daily life.</li><li>The project provides a good balance between residential comfort and accessible outdoor activities.</li><li>Residents will find the property well-suited for a lifestyle that values both convenience and natural surroundings.</li><li>The careful integration of various features creates a cohesive and enjoyable residential setting.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Final Summary</strong><p>Living here offers a comfortable home life with ample outdoor space and convenient access to major city arteries. Families will appreciate the dedicated water play area for children, while all residents can enjoy the landscaped surroundings and easy commutes. The project stands out for its thoughtful balance of residential comfort with significant green and open areas, providing a refreshing environment.</p></div></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false" id="master-plan-details-readmore-1">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

              
            
          </div>
          
       
        
